      "difficulty": "hard",
      "explanation": "Driver apps send updates through the load balancer to the location service, which overwrites the driver's position in a geo-indexed cache. A nearby search is a radius query on that index. Every update is also put on a stream, and workers batch it into trip history. Riders follow their driver over a WebSocket.",
